        {
          "name": "lgh_list",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:34ad4e62ca015d040609c7477ac0421c2b43a6889688435b9bdfb7af3c48cffb",
          "description": "List every Git repository registered with the LGH local server, each with its name, source_path (local working dir), bare_path, clone_url (LGH server URL), and created_at. Reads only the local registry under ~/.localgithub; no network access. Use it to discover the clone_url of an existing backup or the exact registered name required by lgh_remove. Returns a JSON array, empty when nothing is registered.",
