          "name": "lgh_up_dryrun",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:ed9b2ffc9090d7cf5e479edad9cf876fedaf9cfb515d324d59b09e2d7457bc09",
          "description": "Dry-run preview of lgh_up without touching any state: nothing is committed, pushed, registered, or written. Reports whether the directory is a git repo, the pending changed files, LGH registration status (or the name it would auto-register as), and trash-detection results including whether lgh_up would fail and why. Call this before lgh_up whenever you are unsure what a backup would include; use lgh_diff when you want the actual patch content instead of the changed-file list. Returns a JSON object with dry_run=true.",
